# Airtable Personal Access Token for the "Family MTG Airtable PAT".
# This is the credential used by the bundled airtable MCP server to reach the
# "Magic Inventory" base. Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored) and
# replace the placeholder below with the real token. If `.env` is absent, the
# MCP server falls back to reading the token from 1Password via `op read`.
AIRTABLE_API_KEY=your_airtable_personal_access_token_here
